• Shortest path to nearest illicit node  (Spearman r = −0.9182)&lt;br&gt;
• Illicit neighbour ratio (INR)&lt;br&gt;
• Denomination entropy &amp; Mixing index&lt;br&gt;
• Temporal irregularity &amp; Value concentration"
