        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="gap2Interp"
                value="&lt;i&gt;Interpretation:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Null result is informative — multi-dimensional Chamfer geometry&lt;br&gt;
adds value only in temporally dispersed datasets"
